      "id": "claim_edd45fa7ed4e42178c614eaf631cfa32",
      "statement": "createBrijioMcpServer registers exactly 17 tools: list_browsers, list_tabs, read_current_page, click_element, fill_input, fill_editable, set_checked, select_options, upload_file, submit_form, navigate_to_url, open_tab, perform_batch, download_status, download_file, fetch_resource, capture_screenshot. Each tool input includes optional browserInstanceId and tabId except open_tab (no tabId). All return text JSON except capture_screenshot which returns MCP image content.",
