    {
      "id": "claim_97d0af883b264868be3ac19b54fc4f71",
      "statement": "tabId threads from MCP tool input through websocket-client.ts targetEnvelope (envelope.target.tabId) through the relay (forwarded unchanged) to extractTabId in the background controller, which parses message.target.tabId to a number and passes it to handlers/adapters. page-reader.ts and navigateActiveTabToUrl use the provided tabId directly and skip the chrome.tabs.query active-tab lookup; when tabId is undefined they fall back to the active foreground tab, preserving backward compatibility.",
