    {
      "id": "claim_672cd08650bc44f4833dc10bc6aa812b",
      "statement": "list_browsers is answered directly by the WebSocket relay from its in-memory presence table filtered by scopeKey and open sockets; it is never forwarded to an extension. All other requests go through selectBrowser (by browserInstanceId, the single connected browser, or ambiguous_browser_target/browser_unavailable errors) and are forwarded to the extension socket with the pending MCP socket recorded by scopeKey:requestId.",
