    {
      "id": "claim_8e1a035e9dc8491fafe13340e0ea06c6",
      "statement": "submit_form, download_file, and fetch_resource are approval-gated: their envelopes carry actionUUID and approvalRequest true (generated in websocket-client.ts via createApprovalRequestOptions and addBatchActionApprovalMetadata). The BrijioBackgroundController.ensureApprovedAction holds in-memory approval state (approvalSessionGrants) keyed by origin and actionType; approve_session grants skip the prompt for same origin+actionType during the connection. Grants clear on disconnect/reload/session end. Decisions map to approval_denied, approval_timeout (banner hidden), or approval_origin_changed error codes.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/architecture/decisions/0048-client-side-action-approval.md#L40-L58",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:278178b612691dfa1138f8850e1b2a053934142525c741fd498024056645288f:"
        },
