    {
      "id": "claim_6c103c3c92c54392b712430dd686e613",
      "statement": "The relay and extension use packages/shared/src/protocol.ts BrijioErrorCode union while the MCP server keeps its own BrijioErrorCode in servers/mcp/src/protocol.ts for constructing local responses. Because forwarding is passthrough and result error code is string, the two unions need not enumerate identical codes, but they must stay coherent so local constructors emit codes the agent can understand.",
