    {
      "id": "claim_4d85b5e662f9425e956888acf9c1318c",
      "statement": "capture_screenshot (ADR 0064) captures a JPEG (quality 80) viewport of the active tab via chrome.tabs.captureVisibleTab and returns MCP image content plus a text metadata block; it is active-tab only because captureVisibleTab only captures the visible tab and capturing a background tab would require focus switching. The controller's handleScreenshotRequest returns capability_not_supported when the adapter is absent and forwards capture_failed/permission errors.",
